---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Recent Work and Track Record" description="Drone footage and case studies from 160+ completed EV charging, battery storage and utility projects since 2016." path="/work/">
<section id="work"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <p class="label">Recent work</p>
    <h1>Delivered for the networks that set the standard.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Each site below was self-performed by our crews, civil and electrical, from mobilization through utility energization and closeout.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pgrid">
    <article class="pcard"><figure><video class="auto" src="/v-santamonica.mp4" poster="/v-santamonica.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="Drone footage, Santa Monica"></video></figure>
      <div class="proj-body"><p class="label">Electrify America · 2025</p><h3>Santa Monica Flagship</h3><dl class="case"><dt>Scope</dt><dd>10 × 360 kW power units, 20 dispensers</dd><dt>Challenge</dt><dd>Dense urban corner lot, tight staging</dd><dt>Delivered</dt><dd>Full civil, electrical and utility tie-in</dd></dl></div></article>
    <article class="pcard"><figure><video class="auto" src="/v-longbeach.mp4" poster="/v-longbeach.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="Drone footage, Long Beach"></video></figure>
      <div class="proj-body"><p class="label">Tesla · 2026</p><h3>Supercharger, Long Beach</h3><dl class="case"><dt>Scope</dt><dd>31 stalls, 4,000A service</dd><dt>Challenge</dt><dd>Switchboard and 8 cabinets of conduit in one excavation</dd><dt>Delivered</dt><dd>Underground prefabricated, set in one pick</dd></dl></div></article>
    <article class="pcard"><figure><video class="auto" src="/v-midway.mp4" poster="/v-midway.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="Drone footage, Midway"></video></figure>
      <div class="proj-body"><p class="label">EVgo · 2026</p><h3>Midway, San Diego</h3><dl class="case"><dt>Scope</dt><dd>DC fast charging site</dd><dt>Challenge</dt><dd>Active commercial lot</dd><dt>Delivered</dt><dd>Underground, gear pads and equipment set</dd></dl></div></article>
    <article class="pcard"><figure><video class="auto" src="/v-university.mp4" poster="/v-university.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="Drone footage, EVgo University"></video></figure>
      <div class="proj-body"><p class="label">EVgo · 2025</p><h3>University, San Diego</h3><dl class="case"><dt>Scope</dt><dd>DC fast charging in an active retail lot</dd><dt>Delivered</dt><dd>Underground, pads, equipment set and energization</dd></dl></div></article>
    <article class="pcard"><figure><video class="auto" src="/v-nfi.mp4" poster="/v-nfi.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="Drone footage of the NFI Green City rooftop solar array, Ontario"></video><span class="badge"><b>1.1 MW</b>DC rooftop solar</span></figure>
      <div class="proj-body"><p class="label">Electrify America · 2025</p><h3>NFI Green City, Ontario</h3><dl class="case"><dt>Scope</dt><dd>1.1 MW DC rooftop solar</dd><dt>Delivered</dt><dd>Project delivery, underground civil, electrical infrastructure and coordination of the rooftop install</dd></dl></div></article>
    <article class="pcard"><figure><img src="/diner.jpg" alt="The Tesla Diner in Hollywood with the finished concrete site, crosswalks and Supercharger stalls" loading="lazy"><span class="badge"><b>300+</b>yards of concrete</span></figure>
      <div class="proj-body"><p class="label">Tesla · Civil and utility</p><h3>Tesla Diner, Hollywood</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem">Trenching and LADWP service conduits, about 20,000 sq ft of grading, two driveway approaches, curb and gutter, 160+ ft of sidewalk and right-of-way work, and asphalt restoration.</p></div></article>
  </div>

  <div class="tr">
    <div class="tr-head"><p class="label">Track record since 2016</p><h3>Closed-out projects, self-performed civil and electrical.</h3></div>
    <div class="tr-stats">
      <div><b>160+</b><span>Projects completed</span></div>
      <div><b>100+</b><span>Sites for Black &amp; Veatch</span></div>
      <div><b>45+</b><span>Tesla Supercharger projects</span></div>
      <div><b>45</b><span>Battery storage sites</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tr-grid">
      <article class="tr-card"><h4>Black &amp; Veatch · Electrify America</h4><p>Tier 1 subcontractor since 2016, through Black &amp; Veatch and Overland.</p>
        <ul class="chips"><li>Santa Monica flagship</li><li>NFI Green City, Ontario</li><li>Laguna Niguel</li><li>San Luis Obispo</li><li>Manteca</li><li>Camarillo</li><li>Hemet</li><li>Huntington Beach</li><li>Oceanside</li><li>Santa Rosa</li><li>Escondido</li><li>National City</li><li>Rancho Bernardo</li><li>Pismo Beach</li><li class="more-chip">+ more</li></ul></article>
      <article class="tr-card"><h4>Tesla Superchargers</h4><p>Stall counts shown where known.</p>
        <ul class="chips"><li>Sherman Oaks · 44</li><li>Tustin · 44</li><li>Pasadena · 40</li><li>Long Beach · 31</li><li>Truxtun, Bakersfield · 28</li><li>Irvine · 24</li><li>San Juan Capistrano · 24</li><li>Carlsbad · 24</li><li>Granada Hills · 16</li><li>Showroom Place · 16</li><li>El Centro</li><li>Sacramento</li><li>Oakland</li><li>Walnut Creek</li><li class="more-chip">+ more</li></ul></article>
      <article class="tr-card"><h4>Battery storage and charger swaps</h4><p>45 Electrify America battery storage sites and 11 charger swaps, statewide.</p>
        <ul class="chips"><li>Baker</li><li>Olancha</li><li>Fresno</li><li>Fremont</li><li>Los Gatos</li><li>San Jose</li><li>Pleasanton</li><li>Watsonville</li><li>Murrieta</li><li>Fashion Valley</li><li>Redlands</li><li>Seal Beach</li><li>Barstow</li><li>Paso Robles</li><li class="more-chip">+ more</li></ul></article>
      <article class="tr-card"><h4>Fleet and other networks</h4><p>Heavy-duty truck charging, EVgo and independent networks.</p>
        <ul class="chips"><li>WattEV Vernon · MCS truck charging</li><li>EVgo Midway</li><li>EVgo University</li><li>Cleantek Portola</li><li>Cleantek Kettleman City</li><li>Black Diamond Willow Creek</li></ul></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<div class="ctaband"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Have a plan set? We'll price it.</h2>
  <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a bid</a>
</div></div>
</Base>
